{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1520022-questions-about-ctl-1st-edition-print","id":1520022,"title":"Questions about CtL 1st Edition Print","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-08-07T00:44:55-07:00","id":1520022,"title":"Questions about CtL 1st Edition Print","content":"There was no answer from anyone on DriveThruRPG when I asked if the 1st Edition in print is green-colored. The previews for it shows it's green, but the buying options says it's Black &amp; White. I am very interested in purchasing 1st Edition as I already have 2nd Edition, but I would rather have it in the original green-flavored color than Black &amp; White. If anyone can reach out to the good people over at DriveThruRPG to get them to print it in green or to update the preview and/or clarify the color options, it would be very much appreciated. Thank you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25803-omichli","name":"Omichli","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-07T10:33:03-07:00","id":1520045,"title":"","content":"It's in black and white. I've gotten PoD books from DrivethruRPG in the two-tone color-tinted-but-not-full-color style before, and those are listed as color.<br /> <br /> I'm not sure who's in charge of the White Wolf Drivethru store at this point or if they're particularly invested in keeping the CofD/nWoD books updated. Your best bet to get the original green might be to look for used copies from the original print run on Amazon or something, but I haven't checked to see if there are any at a reasonable price.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-08T13:37:24-07:00","id":1520147,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stupid Loserman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1520022-questions-about-ctl-1st-edition-print?p=1520045#post1520045\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's in black and white. I've gotten PoD books from DrivethruRPG in the two-tone color-tinted-but-not-full-color style before, and those are listed as color.<br /> <br /> I'm not sure who's in charge of the White Wolf Drivethru store at this point or if they're particularly invested in keeping the CofD/nWoD books updated. Your best bet to get the original green might be to look for used copies from the original print run on Amazon or something, but I haven't checked to see if there are any at a reasonable price.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you. I'll check it out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25803-omichli","name":"Omichli","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank"